---
import LegalLayout from "../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";

const title = "Privacy Policy";
---

<LegalLayout
  title={title}
  description="How Trusted Buyer Lab handles analytics, affiliate tracking, cookies, and information provided by visitors."
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <p>
    Trusted Buyer Lab respects your privacy. This policy explains the
    information that may be collected when you visit the site and how it is
    used.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We may collect non-personal information such as browser type, device type,
    pages visited, referring pages, and general usage data. If you contact us
    directly, we may collect the information you choose to provide.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>
    The site may use cookies, analytics tools, and affiliate tracking links to
    understand site performance and referral activity. You can disable cookies
    in your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    Some links are affiliate links. When you click an affiliate link and make a
    purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. See our
    <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> for details.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party websites</h2>
  <p>
    The site links to third-party retailers and partner platforms. We are not
    responsible for their privacy practices, policies, or content.
  </p>

  <h2>Data security</h2>
  <p>
    We use reasonable safeguards to protect information, but no website or
    online transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    If you have questions about this policy, contact the website owner through
    the available contact method on this site.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
